      "dcterms:title": "Optimistic calculations about the Witten-Reshetikhin-Turaev invariants of closed three-manifolds obtained from the figure-eight knot by integral Dehn surgeries",
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20080313",
      "dcterms:abstract": "I calculate optimistically asymptotic behaviors of the WRT $SU(2)$ invariants for the three-manifolds obtained from the ﬁgure-eight knot by p- surgeries with $p=0,1,2,$ $\\ldots,$ $10$ , from which one can extract volumes and the Chern-Simons invariants of these closed manifolds. I conjecture that this also holds for general closed three-manifolds.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/1172-5/manifest.jsonld",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "library/1172-5"
    }
  ]
